      "published_at": "2025-02-07T06:21:05Z",
      "draft": false,
      "prerelease": false,
      "body": "1. 添加Match规则编辑\r\n2. 修复首页规则数量不正确的问题\r\n3. 添加日志记录\r\n4. 格式化配置文件的序列化\r\n5. 修复IOS15的代理编辑页面toolbar菜单数量不全的问题\r\n6. 修复IOS15的代理编辑和模块编辑页面添加URL时输入框不显示的问题\r\n7. 修复解析代理时代理名称包含协议会导致解析失败的问题\r\n***\r\n1. Added Match rule editing\r\n2. Fixed the problem of incorrect number of rules on the home page\r\n3. Added logging\r\n4. Formatted serialization of configuration files\r\n5. Fixed the problem of incomplete number of toolbar menus on the proxy editing page of IOS15\r\n6. Fixed the problem of input box not displaying when adding URL on the proxy editing and module editing pages of IOS15\r\n7. Fixed the problem that the proxy name contains the protocol when parsing the proxy, which will cause parsing failure",
